{
  "slug": "barker-stablecoin-skills",
  "name": "Barker Stablecoin Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI Agent Skills for stablecoin yield intelligence — real-time APY from 500+ protocols and 20+ CEX. Free API, no auth required. Powered by Barker.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `agent-payment-stats` (Cross-protocol agent-economy payment metrics from Barker's index), `boost-lifecycle` (Full-lifecycle playbook for Barker boost campaigns: deposit with reward attribution, expiry reminders, reward claiming, redemption, risk monitoring, and…), `stablecoin-chain-explorer` (Explore stablecoin TVL distribution and yield opportunities by blockchain), `stablecoin-depeg-monitor` (Monitor stablecoin peg stability and review historical depeg events), `stablecoin-market-brief` (Get a real-time stablecoin market overview from Barker's yield index: total market cap, yield-bearing stablecoin market cap, asset…), `stablecoin-risk-check` (Assess stablecoin safety and risk profile), `stablecoin-treasury-yield` (Treasury and idle-balance yield for businesses), `stablecoin-tvl-boost` (TVL growth for on-chain protocols and stablecoin issuers), and 3 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install barker-stablecoin-skills@claude-community` from `YBSbarker/barker-stablecoin-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
